WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:05.067
-Dua, one of your biggest fans
is a man named Papa Richy.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.868
All right?
He's 80 years old,

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:09.601
and he went viral on TikTok
after his granddaughter

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.000
surprised him with tickets to
your concert for his birthday.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.667
His reaction got over
7 million views.

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.400
This is real.
Check this out.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.234
-"Admission ticket,
Richard L. Waldorf."

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:22.701
-"And Elena Waldorf."
-"Dua Lipa in concert"?!

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.467
Are you [bleep] me?!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:28.634
Are you [bleep] me?!
Really?!

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:29.968
Is this a real thing?
-Yeah!

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.300
-Holy [bleep]

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.901
-Oh, it's just
such a good video.

00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:39.701
-Yeah.
-It made me so happy.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:41.901
-Well, since he's such
a huge fan of yours,

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:44.534
we wanted to give Papa Richy
another surprise.

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:46.234
And this is real.
It's happening right now, guys.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.467
We reached out to him,

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:49.968
pretending that we were
a radio station, okay?

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:52.133
In New York, and told him
that he won a contest

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.334
for the number-one
TikTok video of the year.

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.200
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.267
Amazing.
-He believed us.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.734
He loved it, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:01.734
So, yesterday, we flew him and
his granddaughter to New York.

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:04.200
He's in our building right now
as we're talking.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.367
The TV monitors are not on
in the building.

00:01:06.367 --> 00:01:08.868
And he thinks he's about to be
interviewed on a radio show

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.300
and get a tour of 30 Rock.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.334
And here he is
a few minutes ago.

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:14.801
We have GoPro cameras.
That's his --

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:15.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:18.334
So he has no clue
what's going down.

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:20.200
And, in fact, someone --

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.334
There was some
"Tonight Show" sign,

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.834
and he said,
"Oh, I love "The Tonight Show.'"

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.367
So I was like, "Oh, cool.
This is gonna be great."

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:26.934
-Well, he's gonna --
he's gonna get the surprise...

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:28.467
-Of his life.
-...of his life.

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:30.901
-All right, so right now,
we all need to be really quiet,

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:33.100
'cause, seriously,
he's being led to what he thinks

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.067
is the radio station.

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:36.968
And what he doesn't know is,
he's about to walk

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:38.534
onto "The Tonight Show"
and meet Dua Lipa.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:39.701
[ Laughter ]
All right?

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:40.868
So, all right, let's get ready.
He's --

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:43.667
-Should I come with you?
-Yeah, you come with me.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:46.534
We'll hear it.
We'll hear it when he's here.

00:01:46.534 --> 00:01:48.767
-Ready as
we're ever gonna be.

00:01:48.767 --> 00:01:50.601
-Your first radio interview?
-First radio interview.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.901
-Oh, great, good.
-Papa, I will follow you.

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.801
-Okay.
I'm gonna follow.

00:01:54.801 --> 00:01:58.167
