00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:00.234
I think we can hear him.

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.868
[ Laughs ]

00:02:04.868 --> 00:02:07.801
-Well, I'll follow you, Pop.

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:09.567
-Okay.
-Okay? You first.

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:11.667
-I'm a real Jimmy Fallon fan.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:13.501
-This is where Jimmy
always gets ready over here.

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:15.634
-Oh, my God!
Hi, Jim.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:20.667
